Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Arizona State University. We greatly appreciate the service of the members of the active military and veterans, and provide staff and resources dedicated to the success of our students who have served.

Once admitted to ASU, you will work with an academic advisor specific to your major and a military advocate. I encourage you to check out the Pat Tillman Veterans Center to learn about our veterans services, events, partnerships, using your benefits and scholarship information at https://veterans.asu.edu/.

Please let me know if you have any questions. I am happy to help.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
